  "description": {
    "text": "One of three Battle Strength Sets (バトル強化セット) released in Japan on 26 December 2015, each 16 cards and a player's guide built for two types, here Grass and Fighting. The set has no symbol or number of its own: its eight reprints keep the number, set symbol and rarity of the expansions they come from, and its three new cards, Leafeon-EX, Golem-EX and Revitalizer, are numbered as XY-P promos. Every card but the Pokémon-EX is a normal non-holo card. Its Gogoat, a holo card in Collection X, is non-holo here.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site: 一挙公開！「バトル強化セット 草/闘」",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon-card.com/products/xy/battle/battle_000313.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Grass/Fighting Battle Strength Set (TCG)",
